    <DocumentationNarrative Id="source:cli:meta-transform-binding:app:narrative:example-example-meta-transform-binding-validate-contract:validate-a-transform-contract" DocumentationSubjectId="source:cli:meta-transform-binding:app" PreviousNarrativeId="source:cli:meta-transform-binding:app:narrative:guide:working-with-metatransformbinding">
      <Body>Bind transform scripts to explicit source and target schemas.

Binding records the resolved source and target evidence only when every required reference and type rule can be proven from the supplied workspaces.

```powershell
meta-transform-binding bind --transform-workspace .\Transforms.Workspace --source-schema .\SourceSchema.Workspace --target-schema .\WarehouseSchema.Workspace --execute-system SourceWarehouse --execute-system-default-schema-name dbo --output-xml .\Binding.Workspace
```</Body>
      <LastReviewedImportBatchId></LastReviewedImportBatchId>
      <Origin>Authored</Origin>
      <ReviewStatus>Current</ReviewStatus>
      <Slot>Example.example:meta-transform-binding:validate-contract</Slot>
      <Title>Validate a transform contract</Title>
    </DocumentationNarrative>
    <DocumentationNarrative Id="source:cli:meta-transform-binding:app:narrative:guide:working-with-metatransformbinding" DocumentationSubjectId="source:cli:meta-transform-binding:app" PreviousNarrativeId="source:cli:meta-transform-binding:app:narrative:summary:summary">
      <Body>`MetaTransformBinding` validates transform scripts against source and target `MetaSchema` workspaces. It resolves referenced objects and columns, checks target write shape, evaluates type compatibility through `MetaDataTypeConversion`, and records the result in a binding workspace.

A successful binding is a concrete statement about what the transform reads and writes. Later quality, pipeline, and orchestration tools can use that evidence instead of reparsing the SQL.</Body>
      <LastReviewedImportBatchId></LastReviewedImportBatchId>
      <Origin>Authored</Origin>
      <ReviewStatus>Current</ReviewStatus>
      <Slot>Guide</Slot>
      <Title>Working with MetaTransformBinding</Title>
    </DocumentationNarrative>
